1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,602
Ren: If you can see the top, you cannot
hear the ground.

2
00:00:03,272 --> 00:00:06,459
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
seven of ten: the tower.

3
00:00:06,779 --> 00:00:10,269
Ren: Hour forty. A broadcast says two
hours.

4
00:00:10,939 --> 00:00:13,564
Ren: Forty floors. No elevator.

5
00:00:14,234 --> 00:00:16,947
Ren: Hand over hand. Never look down.

6
00:00:17,617 --> 00:00:19,922
Ren: The platform. Narrow. Three of them.

7
00:00:20,592 --> 00:00:21,326
Ren: One.

8
00:00:22,592 --> 00:00:23,158
Ren: Two.

9
00:00:24,592 --> 00:00:25,153
Ren: Three.

10
00:00:26,592 --> 00:00:31,192
Ren: The top. A radio. A speaker.

11
00:00:31,862 --> 00:00:35,351
Ren: Evacuate. Two hours. Go to the coast.

12
00:00:36,021 --> 00:00:39,760
Ren: The wind is loud. Everything else is
quiet.

13
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:44,539
Noor: Ren, it loops. Same words, every
four seconds.

14
00:00:45,209 --> 00:00:47,369
Noor: It is a trap, Ren. Nobody is coming.

15
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:51,153
Ren: High ground is safe for now. Not
forever.

16
00:00:51,823 --> 00:00:54,286
Ren: Fake. Someone wants us at the coast.

17
00:00:54,956 --> 00:00:59,831
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part seven of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: checkpoint nine. Follow for part eight.

